  "summary": "Princeton Digital Group announced in April 2026 that it had acquired powered land for JC4, a planned 240 MW campus of four 60 MW buildings on about 106,000 square meters in the Greenland International Industrial Center in Bekasi Regency, Greater Jakarta. The site is about 1.7 km from PDG's JC3 campus, allowing shared power and connectivity infrastructure, and PDG said construction had already begun. No investment figure or completion date has been published.",
